Package: agenticsdr
Version: 0.1.0
Section: hamradio
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: librtlsdr0, debconf, ca-certificates
Recommends: soapysdr-tools
Maintainer: Jeremy Holovacs <jholovacs@gmail.com>
Description: receive-only amateur radio listener
 Agentic SDR opens a USB software-defined radio and serves a page at
 http://127.0.0.1:5088. It can ask an OpenAI-compatible model to run the
 same receive actions. librtlsdr comes from Debian. The speech model is
 downloaded during setup when the network is available.
